      <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></figcaption>
    <div class="plate-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-label="On the left, a straight line from one toward zero running off the edge of the frame and never arriving. On the right, the same two points joined by a circle that returns to itself, labelled pi.">
