        <g font-family="EB Garamond, serif" font-size="12" fill="#a9b6d8" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">
          <text x="190" y="236">a line that runs on resolves nothing</text>
          <text x="570" y="296">a path that curves can return, and so can be</text>
