    <p class="plate-note">Without π there are no circles; without closure the path between the two
      infinities never comes back, and nothing whatever can exist. The move the framework makes here is to
      promote π from a measured ratio to a <em>precondition</em> &mdash; which is exactly the step a critic
      should press hardest. <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></p>
