    <p class="plate-note">Four Riemann sums over one curve. Arithmetically the panels converge on the same
      number, which is the whole point of the limit. The framework's claim &mdash; and it is a claim, not a
      corollary &mdash; is that the <em>act</em> of gathering at a finer grain is not merely a better
      estimate of the same thing, but a different state of the system doing the gathering.</p>
    <p class="muted xsmall">Drawn in context on <a href="/dx/">dx</a>.</p>
