<figure class="plate" id="plate-spiral-2">
    <figcaption class="plate-cap"><span class="plate-num">Plate II</span> One Being's Route &mdash; Up to
      Ten, Then Back Toward Nought <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></figcaption>
    <div class="plate-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 640 640" role="img" aria-label="The same logarithmic spiral of the integers, with one being's route drawn on it. The route climbs from one to ten, forks at ten into a faint half that carries on outward past twenty, and a bright half that turns back, retraces nine, eight and seven down to one, and then spirals inward through ever smaller fractions toward nought without ever arriving.">
