<section class="wrap reveal">
<figure class="plate" id="plate-moebius-1">
    <figcaption class="plate-cap"><span class="plate-num">Plate I</span> A Quarter of the Way Through an
      Inversion <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></figcaption>
    <div class="plate-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-label="Three stages of a twisting ribbon: untwisted at one, rotated ninety degrees and labelled i, and fully half-twisted and inverted at minus one">
        <g font-family="Cinzel, serif" font-size="11" fill="#a9b6d8" letter-spacing="2" text-anchor="middle">
          <text x="130" y="48">0</text><text x="380" y="48">π/2</text><text x="630" y="48">π</text>
        </g>
        <g stroke-width="1.2" fill="none">
          <rect x="80" y="110" width="100" height="70" stroke="#76cfee"/>
          <path d="M80 110 L180 110 M80 180 L180 180" stroke="#76cfee"/>
          <path d="M350 100 L410 118 L410 192 L350 210 Z" stroke="#45d6b4"/>
          <path d="M600 112 L660 100 L660 190 L600 178 Z" stroke="#a07cf0"/>
          <path d="M600 178 L660 190" stroke="#ef84b6"/>
        </g>
        <g font-family="EB Garamond, serif" font-size="14" fill="#cdefff" text-anchor="middle">
          <text x="130" y="236">1</text>
          <text x="380" y="236">i</text>
          <text x="630" y="236">&#8722;1</text>
        </g>
        <g font-family="EB Garamond, serif" font-size="12" fill="#a9b6d8" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">
          <text x="130" y="262">two faces, as they were</text>
          <text x="380" y="262">rotated, not yet inverted</text>
          <text x="630" y="262">one face: the identification</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p class="plate-note">i² = &minus;1: performing the imaginary rotation twice completes the half-twist
      and produces inversion. <span class="sci">&#9670;</span> The reading the framework adds is that
      <em>i is not imaginary in the sense of being unreal — it is imaginary in the sense of being halfway
      through an inversion.</em> <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></p>
    <p class="muted xsmall">Drawn in context on <a href="/moebius/">Möbius</a>.</p>
</figure>
