<section class="wrap reveal">
<figure class="plate" id="plate-cosmic-ledger-1">
    <figcaption class="plate-cap"><span class="plate-num">Plate I</span> The Riemann Sphere and Its Three
      Poles <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></figcaption>
    <div class="plate-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 340" role="img" aria-label="A sphere with a horizontal complex plane through it, marked with poles at zero, one half and one, each labelled with its residue and the cosmic component it is claimed to encode, and a point at infinity on top with residue minus one">
        <g fill="none" stroke="#76cfee" stroke-width="1">
          <circle cx="380" cy="170" r="120"/>
          <ellipse cx="380" cy="170" rx="120" ry="36"/>
        </g>
        <g stroke="#a9b6d8" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.6">
          <path d="M120 206 H640"/>
        </g>
        <g font-family="EB Garamond, serif" font-size="12" fill="#cdefff" text-anchor="middle">
          <circle cx="300" cy="206" r="5" fill="#76cfee"/><text x="300" y="232">z = 0</text>
          <circle cx="380" cy="206" r="5" fill="#45d6b4"/><text x="380" y="232">z = ½</text>
          <circle cx="470" cy="206" r="5" fill="#a07cf0"/><text x="470" y="232">z = 1</text>
          <circle cx="380" cy="50" r="5" fill="#ef84b6"/><text x="380" y="38">z = &#8734;</text>
        </g>
        <g font-family="Cinzel, serif" font-size="9" fill="#a9b6d8" letter-spacing="1.5" text-anchor="middle">
          <text x="300" y="250">BARYONIC</text><text x="300" y="264">0.0495</text>
          <text x="380" y="250">DARK MATTER</text><text x="380" y="264">0.2695</text>
          <text x="470" y="250">DARK ENERGY</text><text x="470" y="264">0.6810</text>
          <text x="380" y="24">RESIDUE &#8722;1</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p class="plate-note">Because the global residue theorem fixes R₁ + R<sub>½</sub> + R₀ + R<sub>∞</sub>
      = 0 with R<sub>∞</sub> = &minus;1, the three positive residues must sum to one. In this account the
      percentages are not adjustable: they are the algebraic fingerprints of a universe that
      balances.</p>
    <p class="muted xsmall">Drawn in context on <a href="/cosmic-ledger/">The Ledger</a>.</p>
</figure>
